    id 73
    label "cuVUU9vBM5o"
    step 0
    date "2022-02-22T14:19:41Z"
    title "How Nanotechnology Can Help To End Water Scarcity Crisis"
    description "Covering the topics of Nanotechnology, Freshwater, Water Scarcity Crisis, New Technology, and more!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Don&amp;#180;t forget to leave your comments below and to support the channel by liking the video and subscribing. Thanks!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe To The Tesla Domain &amp;#10145; https://bit.ly/2ECNiWk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WATCH NEXT &amp;#128071;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Carbon Nanotubes Will Revolutionize The Renewable Energy Industry!&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/a4CkV9ZmRkw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128293; RELATED VIDEOS:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Tesla Comes Close To 4680 Battery Production While Closes HUGE Battery Deal!!!&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/KOz7sDs5wBU&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; These New Perovskite Solar Cells Can Revolutionize The Energy Industry!!&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/qXvMWTqoVaw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; This Startup Is About To Revolutionize Hydrogen Storage For EVs!!!&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/RIb4d393AaI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; GAMECHANGER!! Watch Out For This 100% Silicon Nanowire Battery Tech!!&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/w9hS8nf_pQg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; This Startup Is Taking HUGE Steps For Scaling Up Its NEW Lithium Metal Battery!!!&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/GoU_H1ZKSa0&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Water is a limited resource, and for many nations &amp;#8212; notably those in the Middle East &amp;#8212; supplies already fall short of demand. With the demands of climate change and population increase, water will become progressively scarcer, especially in emerging nations. Moreover, in these locations, little water is typically dangerous to drink. Drinking, washing, and toilet flushing combined only amounts to 8 percent of our yearly freshwater usage. Instead, the elephant in the&amp;#8230;pool&amp;#8230;is irrigation for agriculture, which drains up to 70 percent of our freshwater consumption.&amp;#10;Water shortages and lack of access to quality drinking water will continue to rise as major worldwide challenges. At present, more than one billion people lack access to clean drinking water and 2.4 billion people lack access to basic sanitation, practically all of them in developing nations. At now a third of the world's population lives in water-stressed nations, and by 2025, this is anticipated to climb to two-thirds.&amp;#10;Nanotechnology might be the answer to providing a secure supply of drinking water for places of the world affected by recurrent drought or where water poisoning is common. Written in the International Journal of Nuclear Desalination, researchers in India explain how carbon nanotubes might replace conventional materials in water purification systems.&amp;#10;Some claim a nano revolution is at hand, maybe not an excessively enthusiastic judgment considering the rising pervasiveness of nanotechnology and its quick speed of development. The water resource industry is among the fields projected to gain from nanotechnology, its use showing significant promise for treatment and remediation; sensing and detection; and pollution control. That cuts a fairly large swath in the water resources industry.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;___________________________________________________________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#129321; The Tesla Domain is the Number 1 channel to go when you want to be up to date with the latest Tesla news, rumors, and insights. Covering everything related to Elon Musk, Tesla, Space X, The Boring Company, Neuralink, Hyperloop, and the EV industry as a whole! We post videos about every Tesla vehicle, including the Cybertruck, Model 3, Model Y, Model S, Model X, Semi, Roadster, and all the other upcoming EVs from different car manufacturers! &amp;#10;___________________________________________________________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#129400; Disclaimer: All the information provided on this channel and/or videos is of general nature and for entertainment purposes only, and you should use it as a place to start your own research. All reasonable efforts have been made to ensure the accuracy of the information provided, working with sources that we believe to be reliable, but subject to change at any time, without notice.&amp;#10;___________________________________________________________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128483; Copyright Disclaimer: Section 107 of the U.S. Copyright Act states: &amp;#8220;Notwithstanding the provisions of sections 106 and 106A, the fair use of a copyrighted work, including such use by reproduction in copies or phonorecords or by any other means specified by that section, for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching (including multiple copies for classroom use), scholarship, or research, is not an infringement of copyright.&amp;#8221; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;This video could contain certain copyrighted video clips, pictures, or photographs that were not specifically authorized to be used by the copyright holder(s), but which we believe in good faith are protected by federal law and the fair use doctrine for one or more of the reasons noted above.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For copyright issues or business inquiries please contact us at successpillyt@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#elonmusk #tesla #thetesladomain"
