    date "2018-06-22T08:38:18Z"
    title "Science Talk: What is Nanoscience/Nanotechnology? ?"
    description "Welcome to our first episode of Science Talk! Today we are explaining what nanoscience and nanotech are! We hope that our explanation can help you to better understand this field. Stay tuned for more Science Talks in the near future.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Visit us at: https://qns.science/&amp;#10;Social Media: @qnsscience &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Resources and further reading&amp;#10;---------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;- Wiki article on Nanotechnology&amp;#10;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nanotechnology&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- Detailed article by howstuffworks&amp;#10;https://science.howstuffworks.com/nanotechnology4.htm&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- Computer of the first moon landing&amp;#10;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_Guidance_Computer&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- Colloidal Gold:&amp;#10;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colloidal_gold&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- On the weird world of quantum mechanics:&amp;#10;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wave%E2%80%93particle_duality&amp;#10;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_cat&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- The Guardian - St. Pauli pees back&amp;#10;https://www.theguardian.com/cities/2015/mar/04/st-pauli-pees-back-hamburg-red-light-district-revenge&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- The Guardian - Postcards from the nanoworld&amp;#10;https://www.theguardian.com/science/gallery/2013/sep/06/nanotechnology-world-pictures&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Other videos about nanotechnology:&amp;#10;---------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;- The strange new world of Nanoscience - By Cambridge University&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=70ba1DByUmM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- What is nanotechnology? - By risk bites&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DAOFpgocfrg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- Engineers bounce water off superhydrophobic surfaces - By Brigham Young University&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SIiv-hkRvZE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- St. Pauli Peeback (German only)&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?time_continue=51&amp;#38;v=uoN5EteWCH8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us&amp;#10;---------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;- Facebook Center for Quantum Nanoscience: https://www.facebook.com/CenterforQuantumNanoScience&amp;#10;- Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/QNSorg&amp;#10;- Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/QNSorg&amp;#10;- http://qns.science/"
