  [
    id 155
    label "GqJwmJD0_m4"
    step 0
    date "2021-06-30T02:47:34Z"
    title "INTRODUCING NEW NANOTECHNOLOGY IN COSMETICS"
    description "Nanotechnology is an innovative science that includes the design, characterization, production and application of structures by controlling the size at the nanometer scale, which covers the size range from 1 nanometer to 100 nanometer (nm).  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;It is not news to cosmetic companies that nanotechnology is the way of the future and is considered as the hottest and emerging technology available. Cosmetic manufacturers use nanoscale versions of ingredients to provide better UV protection, deeper skin penetration, long-lasting effects, increased color and improved finish quality.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Modern sunscreens made from nanoparticles like zinc oxide can absorb harmful ultraviolet rays light more quickly. These nanoparticles protect our skin from UV rays and at the same time, protect us from dangerous skin illnesses.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In the cosmetics industry, different materials are suspended and encapsulated in nanoemulsions to penetrate deeper into our skin for greater efficiency. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;In VNI SCIENTIFIC, Nanotechnology cosmetics refers to the Nano emulsion that is used to encapsulate the herbal extracts.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;VNI SCIENTIFIC exclusive formulations include natural actives derived from traditional herbal extracts &amp;#8211; treasures from the Rainforest supported by scientific research.&amp;#10;Why you should choose VNI SCIENTIFIC?&amp;#10;We are: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127808; An eco-friendly cosmeceutical manufacturing company that is GMP and Halal certified and syariah compliant &amp;#10;&amp;#127808; Trusted manufacturer of private label colour cosmetics, skincare, personal care and hygiene products found in community pharmacies, retail outlets, and on online channels  &amp;#10;&amp;#127808; A pioneer in the research and development of cosmetic products using nanotechnology for beauty cosmetics&amp;#10;&amp;#127808; A passionate advocate for rainforest beauty with extracts from rainforests as main actives in nanoemulsions for skin beauty and health.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more inquires don&amp;#8217;t hesitate to contact us at&amp;#128071;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9993; Business Inquiries: hello@vniscientific.com&amp;#10;or visit our website at:&amp;#10;https://vnibioc.com&amp;#10;https://vnibioc.com&amp;#10;https://vnibioc.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;**************&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Be sure to subscribe for more info on Nanotechnology in cosmetics at: &amp;#10;YouTube &amp;#9658;  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OCaLs5EuXr8&amp;#38;t=39s&amp;#10;Facebook &amp;#9658; https://www.facebook.com/vnibioc&amp;#10;Instagram &amp;#9658; https://www.instagram.com/vni_bioc/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#nanotechnologycosmetics #biocellulosemask #innovation #rainforestherbs"
