    date "2015-04-01T10:37:27Z"
    title "King Abdullah Institute for Nanotechnology (KAIN), King Saud University"
    description "Saudi Arabia's KAIN is a leading research institute that provides educational support to the university. It has been instrumental in 4 main aspects: providing state of the art instruments for materialsynthesis and characterization, encouraging local and international collaboration, increasing educational opportunities, and serving local communities with state-of-the-art facilities. KAIN structure has made it possible for faculty, researchers, and graduate students from different disciplines to work together and collaborate. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Furthermore, it gave graduate students the ability to excel and compete in local and international conferences owing to the multidisciplinary environment adopted at KAIN.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;http://hesr.ksu.edu.sa/en/content/king-abdullah-institute-nano-technology-kain"
