    title "Nanotechnology | Beyond our imagination | In Bangla"
    description "The use of nanotechnology in today's world is unprecedented, as the famous American Richard Feynman described the concept of nanotechnology in 1959 in his talk There's plenty of room at the bottom. We are usually familiar with millimeters, including meters, kilometers, grams, liters, to measure anything. But in #nanotechnology #infografic #nowlez #newtechnology #technology #coolscience #sciencefact  #education #knowledge reality it is very difficult to understand how small the nanometer is, for example the hair of your head, can you imagine what its radius or diameter might be?&amp;#10;But if you are told that little human hair is 1 million nanometers in diameter. Or if a pen-drawn spot is about a million meters wide, it will be useful for you to understand how small the bisie we are talking about or how small it can be 1 nanometer.&amp;#10;Thanks for watching, do Subscribe &amp;#38; stay with us for more videos.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#nanotechnology #infografic #nowlez #newtechnology #technology #coolscience #sciencefact  #education #knowledge"
