  [
    id 254
    label "Qo2NCWDUFHs"
    step 0
    date "2018-10-26T21:47:14Z"
    title "Working in Nanotechnology Research Lab | Day in the life of a research scientist."
    description "Nanotechnology is one of the key technology nowadays al w&amp;#225;round the world. Almost all electronic devices have the touch of nanotechnology. From outside of the science, anyone can imagine working in a nanotechnology research lab is simple, but it is not. It demands hard work to work in a scientific laboratory. The intent of this video is to share where I am working, it may give you a clear idea about a day in the life of a research scientist. It is an atomic layer deposition so-called ALD lab. This room is named a cleanroom where all dust is removed by a special technology named cleanroom technology. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;The atomic layer deposition needs a clean and dust-free environment cause it deals with atomic level particles that can be easily contaminated by dust in the room. For that reason, a special dress is required before entering the atomic layer deposition room.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;More videos in Matescium:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Secret of the perpetual motion machine | Bhaskara&amp;#8217;s Wheel&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/eqUe8IrJSPE&amp;#10;1000 Subscribers | Thank you all awesome people&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/I8qR0hyJYRE&amp;#10;Can you trap light in a mirror box | Light trapping box&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/v45HhFV3h7Y &amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;Thanks for watching it.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#Nanotechnology #ScientificLab #ALD #CleanroomTechnology"
    channeltitle "Matescium"
    channelid "UCIMDCfaEyjOTQbcTt97zRaw"
