    title "Nanotechnology - Part 1 | Science  Technology | Tone Academy | Nikhil"
    description "Nanotechnology is the most under-tapped area in the field of Science and Technology in India.&amp;#10;This video explains in-depth about:&amp;#10;i. Definition of Nanotechnology&amp;#10;ii. Generations of Nanotechnology&amp;#10;iii. Types of Nanotechnology&amp;#10;iv. Advantages &amp;#38; Disadvantages of Nanotechnology&amp;#10;v. Applications of Nanotechnology&amp;#10;vi. Problems with Nanotechnology&amp;#10;vii. Issues with Nanotechnology in India&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#Nanotechnology #GenerationsinNanotechnology #RichardFeyman #PassiveNanostructure #ActiveNanostructure #SystemofNanostructure #TypesofNanotechnology #AdvantagesandDisadvantagesofNanotechnology #ApplicationofNanotechnologyinElectronicsITMedicalandHealthcareApplication #EnergyApplication #EnvironmentalRemediation #FutureTransportation #ProblemswithNanotechnology #IssueswithNanotechnologyinIndia&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For any queries/doubts/information - we are just an email away - mail us @ askme@toneacademy.in &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to : https://bit.ly/2YQOgbs &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Landforms Of The Earth &amp;#8211; Plateaus - https://youtu.be/Z4ns_Txltc8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Articles -  https://youtu.be/C8SyvvYDIKU&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Urban Land Ceiling Act, 1976 - https://youtu.be/rLE72KHJmhE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Kepler&amp;#8217;s Law &amp;#38; Satellite Orbits - https://youtu.be/Jot5fgiK5EA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Pipes &amp;#38; Cisterns- Concept - 7 - More or Less - https://youtu.be/wB5QjRBN4lw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Buddhism-Five Great Events in Buddha&amp;#8217;s Life - https://youtu.be/sFWGaD_U74Y&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subject &amp;#38; Predicate - https://youtu.be/JugOlZc3k6A&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Alexander&amp;#8217;s Invasion &amp;#8211; Impact - https://youtu.be/nCaeta2CvIk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fundamental Rights - Right To Constitutional Remedies Part 15 - https://youtu.be/2voQOxnQ76w&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Igneous Rocks -  https://youtu.be/q4DfTliVbTI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The Rise Of Magadhan Empire - https://youtu.be/MK0dw5C