    title "What are the types of Nanotechnology?"
    description "Nanoscale materials are used for several bulk applications. Nano fillers are formed which are used in solar cells for the reduction of their production cost. Nanotechnology has made a great contribution for biomedical field. Applications like tissue engineering, drug delivery, and biosensors are evolved. It leads to research of genetics and DNA technology.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Nanotechnology has helped in the structuring of artificial DNA and the study of some other nucleic acids. In the synthesis of materials, nano technology has helped in designing of well-shaped molecules. New fabrication techniques like nano lithography, Atomic Layer deposition were developed.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;www.hdintution.com"
