    title "KLAPiT SUPER HOOK with Enhanced Nanotechnology that Makes It the Strongest Heavy Duty Hook"
    description "Moving into your new home is a great occasion for everyone. But organizing your new home is a big challenge, especially when it comes to using your wall space efficiently.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Do you still drill your hooks into your walls because your adhesive hooks keep falling off? You need not wait anymore. Introducing KLAPiT SUPER HOOK that uses Enhanced Nanotechnology making it the strongest heavy duty hook.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The Enhanced Nanotechnology used in KLAPiT SUPER HOOK uses concentrated Van Der Waal's forces that helps your hook to firmly attach to the wall without establishing any chemical bond between the two surfaces. This technology is also used in KLAPiT SUPER TAPE. This technology enables the hook to:&amp;#10;1) Attach instantly to the wall or any other hard and smooth surface&amp;#10;2) Hold heavy weights of up to 5Kg or 11Lb&amp;#10;3)  Remove cleanly&amp;#10;&amp;#10;KLAPiT SUPER HOOK is now available in the UAE."
