  [
    id 304
    label "r0h8Br9rp3g"
    step 0
    date "2022-01-12T12:33:06Z"
    title "Applications of nanotechnology I Dr. Jamal Uddin"
    description "This presentation is for all who would like to know numerous applications of nanotechnology. This video shows how nanotechnology can be used in various field including  Covid-19 vaccine, Drug delivery, energy and environment. This video has been published in this channel with permission of the speaker &amp;#38; contribution to Dept of EEE, Ahsanullah University of Science and Technology (AUST) for organizing such a wonderful seminar is greatly acknowledged.&amp;#10;&amp;#11088;All isotherm models fitting: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hb8tJmHCsTo&amp;#38;list=PLxbTf96DhNSSZtzz1OEK5_oOR4Mb05hvU&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088;How to fit all kinetic models: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NUM11s1X-68&amp;#38;list=PLxbTf96DhNSTS0j5d-LengkeEQS1qjrOC&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088;All XPS tutorials: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t2xrywy5988&amp;#38;list=PLxbTf96DhNSQ7rUoY1jklJbkVO9RTxhuN&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088;All adsorption study: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qETbY2cOy4I&amp;#38;list=PLxbTf96DhNST3w6Pp5RU_SdXB8Aioauc9&amp;#10;&amp;#10;All origin tips and tricks: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tia-5pnDA80&amp;#38;list=PLxbTf96DhNSRHvTqXBQ0Rsii6qmhrn1xh&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Point of zero charge determination: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=18hvaYbfdrc&amp;#38;list=PLxbTf96DhNSRSyVJEuUURtphTVyUkilTi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BET specific surface area detrmination: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_7OZrokDY3c&amp;#38;list=PLxbTf96DhNSQ2NNF1nsX1RcdFAhrVx9Fz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to fit all isotherm models: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hb8tJmHCsTo&amp;#38;list=PLxbTf96DhNSSZtzz1OEK5_oOR4Mb05hvU&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Calculation of thermodynamic parameters: https://youtu.be/g6t_Ze5tCAM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to plot UV-Visible spectrum using Origin easily: https://youtu.be/Qn_nmCfucaQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to plot XPS survey graph using Origin: https://youtu.be/t2xrywy5988&amp;#10;&amp;#10;All adsorption kinetic models fitting: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NUM11...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to download, install and use origin 2021 freely: https://youtu.be/Tia-5pnDA80&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to fit nonlinear Redlich-Peterson (RP) isotherm model: https://youtu.be/iHE2i5cLpLk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to fit nonlinear pseudo-second-order kinetic model: https://youtu.be/uJKwSDvVPRM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to write a good title: https://youtu.be/9t4gcumWq64&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to write a good abstract: https://youtu.be/YF9cR6uBQ9E&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to select the best keywords: https://youtu.be/ZKa7LLz6r2k&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to do a literature review in your field: https://youtu.be/mvFzwGDh9A&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to calculate molar extinction coefficient of methylene blue in Origin:&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/EXAmdIWsQtQ&amp;#10;BET Isotherm plotting in OriginPro easily: https://youtu.be/rdJu7mo8bK8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BET Specific Surface area (SSA) calculation using BET Isotherm: https://youtu.be/5mcrT6mO3b0&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Specific Surface Area (SSA) and its determination: https://youtu.be/_7OZrokDY3c&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to fit Pseudo First Order kinetic model: https://youtu.be/NUM11s1X-68&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to fit Langmuir and Freundlich equation: https://youtu.be/uVlPeDYY8SA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to plot multi-panel graph: https://youtu.be/-_tlHbTiVNE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to import Mendeley citation: https://youtu.be/AAmpxtWqIgU&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What are the Coloild and Tyndal effect? https://youtu.be/HveqaZDZF9U&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks for watching and please do subscribe to my channel. If you don't understand or if you have any confusion on the content of this video, please comment in the comment section, I will get back to you as soon as possible.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088;Please join: https://www.facebook.com/aminulchem.i...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; Follow me on&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Google Scholar: https://scholar.google.com/citations?...&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/aminulchem&amp;#10;Scopus: https://www.scopus.com/authid/detail....&amp;#10;Publons: https://publons.com/researcher/699183...&amp;#10;Researchgate: https://www.researchgate.net/profile/...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9888; DISCLAIMER: &amp;#10;This Channel does not promote any illegal product, content, or platform, doesn't&amp;#10; encourage any kind of prohibited activities. All contents provided by this channel are meant for Education, research, publishing, innovation, and knowledge sharing only.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#AminulchemInnovation #applicationsofnanotechnology&amp;#10; #nanotechnology #nano #nanotech  #jamaluddin  #AminulSir #Aminulchem #DrMdAminulIslam #MAI #DMAI"
