  [
    id 390
    label "TuA5QUgkDMI"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-06T19:15:00Z"
    title "All Capabilities of Nanotechnology At This Moment"
    description "All Capabilities of Nanotechnology At This Moment&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128276; Subscribe now with all notifications on for more Nanotechnology news, Science Technology news and Future Technology news&amp;#10;&amp;#10;These days, you will not surprise people with the word &amp;#8220;Nanotechnology&amp;#8221;, yet many people do not even realize the great impact nanotechnology has on our lives. Nanotechnology is modern science, engineering, and technology, which is conducted at the nanoscale (1-100 nanometers). One nanometer is equal to a billionth of a meter. To give you a clear example, a single sheet of newspaper is 100,000 nanometers thick. You should know that atoms and molecules behave completely differently at the nanoscale.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#Nanotechnology #Nanobots #Technology&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128250; Fun fact: Smart people watch the full video!&amp;#10;_________________________________________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;About Nano Tech News&amp;#10;&amp;#127909; Videos about Nanotechnology, Artificial Intelligence and Technology&amp;#10;&amp;#127912; Written, voiced and produced by Nano Tech News&amp;#10;&amp;#128276; Subscribe now for more Tech news, Future Tech and Biotechnology news videos&amp;#10;&amp;#10;_____________________________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#128188; Contact &amp;#38; Copyright Questions&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; For copyright cases, business inquiries or other inquiries please contact us at: Now.nanotech@gmail.com"
