    id 501
    label "3xhqxnJd5wY"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-13T04:13:17Z"
    title "Phase 1: Environmental, Health and Safety Research in the Risk Assessment of Nanomaterials"
    description "The project involves the Environmental,, Health and Safety Research in the Risk Assessment of Nanomaterials. The specific objectives are: (1) to determine the physical and chemical characteristics of locally manufactured nanomaterials,, (2) to evaluate the health hazard on the manufacture and use of nanomaterials,, (3) to conduct release analysis and transport of nanomaterials in the environment, (4) to assess the risk associated with the production and use of nanomaterials,, and (5) to develop guidance/testing manuals on nanomaterials and nanotechnology products. The nanomaterials from R &amp;#38; D that have near-term potential for large-scale/commercial production,, and commercialized nanotechnology products in the local market will be analyzed in this study. This study will develop/identify methods to quantify and analyze the release potential of nanomaterials in the environment. Testing protocol on nanomaterials and nanotechnology products will be developed as guidance for future nano-labelling of the local nano-enabled products. The results of this study will be used in the risk management of nanomaterials and nanotechnology products for input to decision making by the government in terms of product use and regulation.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CONNECT WITH US!  &amp;#10;Website: https://pcieerd.dost.gov.ph   &amp;#10;DOST-PCIEERD Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/dostpcieerd &amp;#10;Pinoy Science Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/pinoyscience &amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/dostpcieerd/ &amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/dostpcieerd &amp;#10;LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/dost... &amp;#10;YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/DOSTPCIEERD...&amp;#10;TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@pinoyscience&amp;#10;#scienceforthepeople #dostph #pcieerd #DOSTPhilippines #innovatepinas"
    channeltitle "DOST PCIEERD, Innovation Council"
    channelid "UCk2YhykDEnpaJ09nx-dfxBw"
