    step 0
    date "2022-07-12T10:31:02Z"
    title "Bengaluru India Nano Talks 2022 - (1). Smart Glass by Dr Giridhar U. Kulkarni"
    description "The Vision Group on Nanotechnology (VGNT) of Govt. of Karnataka is functioning under the Honorary Chairmanship of Bharat Ratna Prof. C.N.R. Rao, FRS, Honorary President, Jawaharlal Nehru Centre for Advanced Scientific Research (JNCASR) &amp;#38; Linus Pauling Research Professor and the Chairmanship of Prof. Navakanta Bhat, Dean, Division of Interdisciplinary Sciences, IISc for promotion of Nanoscience and Nanotechnology in Karnataka.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Under the guidance of this Vision Group on Nanotechnology, the Department of Electronics, IT, Bt and Science and Technology is organizing Bengaluru India Nano monthly webinar series as a platform to reach out to a large number of audience and keep them connected to Bengaluru India Nano brand.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The inaugural talk by Dr Giridhar U. Kulkarni (President, Jawaharlal Nehru Centre for Advanced Scientific Research and Director In-charge, CeNS) on Smart Glass"
